/E (The Challenge)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
282 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 69 0 R
/E (The strategic question: Delhivery's OSRM system underestimates actual delivery time on a significant fraction of routes. Can a graph-based model, one that treats the logistics network as a connected graph of facilities and corridors, not a collection of independent point-to-point estimates, produce more accurate ETAs and identify which corridors and hubs are systematically causing delays?)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
